[h1]核心循环 / Core Loop[/h1]

[h3]跨世余烬与轮回当铺 / Ember Tier & Reincarnation Shop[/h3]
游戏规则提供绝对/本世成长赛道与 0/25/50/100% 继承，推荐本世成长 + 100%。非零预算会打开四页当铺：属性、资源、借命、重抽、封印、恐怖值、正统性、暴政修正、免费宗教改革，以及 10000/50000/100000 分批量强化；余分开始此生时等量转为金币。
Choose Absolute or Lifetime Growth scoring and uncapped 0/25/50/100% inheritance. Spend the next life's budget across four shop pages, including attributes, resources, Health, rerolls, seals, crown services, faith reformation, and high-tier bulk upgrades; unspent points become gold.
[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/XenoAmess/ck3_eternal_recurrence/bdc87ac77a3207945343ccdf277d6c4259bce65c/screenshots/gallery/02_reincarnation_shop.jpg[/img]

[h3]一份祝福，一道咒痕 / One Blessing, One Curse[/h3]
开局及此后每三年，从带稀有度/构筑标签的三项祝福中领一项，再从两项诅咒中强制选择一项。每场恰好一对；重抽可换祝福，封印可免咒痕，拒绝整场则最终分数 -1%。
Every three years, choose one of three labeled blessings, then one of two mandatory curses. Each session is exactly one pair; rerolls replace blessings, seals waive curses, and declining costs 1% final score.
[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/XenoAmess/ck3_eternal_recurrence/bdc87ac77a3207945343ccdf277d6c4259bce65c/screenshots/gallery/03_blessing_choice.jpg[/img]
[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/XenoAmess/ck3_eternal_recurrence/bdc87ac77a3207945343ccdf277d6c4259bce65c/screenshots/gallery/04_curse_choice.jpg[/img]

[h3]账簿与本世契约 / Ledger & Lifetime Contracts[/h3]
原生决议可随时打开【琉焰账簿】，只读查看即时分数、历史/候选/下一位阶、差值、交易对数与拒绝次数。征服者、织网者、圣徒、家主、贤王、享乐者六类契约把 CK3 行为变成增量目标；3/6/10 进度提供反馈、分数和跨存档 PB。
The native Decisions panel opens a read-only ledger with live score, historical/candidate/next tiers, gap, pairs, and refusals. Six contracts turn warfare, hooks, conversion, family, construction, and low-stress longevity into incremental goals with 3/6/10 feedback and persistent PBs.
[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/XenoAmess/ck3_eternal_recurrence/bdc87ac77a3207945343ccdf277d6c4259bce65c/screenshots/gallery/05_glassfire_ledger.jpg[/img]
[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/XenoAmess/ck3_eternal_recurrence/bdc87ac77a3207945343ccdf277d6c4259bce65c/screenshots/gallery/06_lifetime_contracts.jpg[/img]

[h3]典造琉焰廷臣 / Commission a Glassfire Courtier[/h3]
花费游戏内金币典造一名宫廷成员：0–120 岁、六项 0–100 基础能力、25 教育、17 将才、38 身体、36 性格、108 其他原生特质，以及所有已载入文化与信仰；可选择出身卑微或归入玩家家族。只有成功交付才扣款，AI 没有入口。“付费”不涉及现实货币。
Spend in-game gold to commission a courtier with exact age and skills, 224 selectable native traits, every loaded culture and faith, and lowborn or player-house origin. Gold is charged only after delivery; AI has no entry point or real-money purchase.
[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/XenoAmess/ck3_eternal_recurrence/bdc87ac77a3207945343ccdf277d6c4259bce65c/screenshots/gallery/08_courtier_essentials.jpg[/img]

[h3]一生一次结算 / One Life, One Settlement[/h3]
死亡时逐项展示真实分数；只有跨过新阈值才写入量化纪录。有继承人时确认后进入观察者模式；无可玩继承人时由原生继承窗显示八项结算并退出主菜单。两者都不可继续扮演后代。
Death shows the full exact-score breakdown and writes a record only after crossing a new threshold. Confirmation enters observer mode when an heir exists; without a playable heir, the native succession window shows the settlement and exits to menu. Neither path continues as a descendant.
[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/XenoAmess/ck3_eternal_recurrence/bdc87ac77a3207945343ccdf277d6c4259bce65c/screenshots/gallery/10_death_settlement.jpg[/img]

[h1]琉焰之视 / Glassfire Gaze[/h1]
每完成一对祝福与诅咒获得 1 XP；每 10 XP 提升一级、增加压力获取，并交替解锁重抽与封印。原生特质悬浮提示即时预览当前分数。
Each completed pair grants 1 XP. Every 10 XP raises the trait level and stress cost while unlocking rerolls and seals; the native trait tooltip previews the live score.

[h1]本地化与兼容性 / Localization & Compatibility[/h1]
简中 / English / Français / Deutsch / 日本語 / 한국어 / Polski / Русский / Español

实测基线 CK3 1.19.0.6；推荐新开局、单机。无继承人结算会投影原生 window_succession_event.gui，与覆盖同一文件的 mod 冲突；其他同键 on_action、GUI 或资源组合不作保证。
Tested on CK3 1.19.0.6; a new single-player game is recommended. The no-heir settlement projects the native succession window and conflicts with mods replacing the same GUI; other same-key on_action, GUI, or asset combinations are not guaranteed.

[h1]一局有多长 / Run Length[/h1]
一局就是签约统治者的一生；30–50 年通常经历约 10–17 次垂青会。/ One run is the contracted ruler's lifetime; 30–50 years usually contains about 10–17 favor sessions.

